schema:
Node properties are the following:
Movie {posterEmbedding: LIST, url: STRING, runtime: INTEGER, revenue: INTEGER, budget: INTEGER, plotEmbedding: LIST, imdbRating: FLOAT, released: STRING, countries: LIST, languages: LIST, plot: STRING, imdbVotes: INTEGER, imdbId: STRING, year: INTEGER, poster: STRING, movieId: STRING, tmdbId: STRING, title: STRING}, Genre {name: STRING}, User {userId: STRING, name: STRING}, Actor {url: STRING, name: STRING, tmdbId: STRING, bornIn: STRING, bio: STRING, died: DATE, born: DATE, imdbId: STRING, poster: STRING}, Director {url: STRING, bornIn: STRING, bio: STRING, died: DATE, born: DATE, imdbId: STRING, name: STRING, poster: STRING, tmdbId: STRING}, Person {url: STRING, bornIn: STRING, bio: STRING, died: DATE, born: DATE, imdbId: STRING, name: STRING, poster: STRING, tmdbId: STRING}, _Bloom_Perspective_ {version: STRING, roles: LIST, id: STRING, name: STRING, data: STRING}, _Bloom_Scene_ {ranges: STRING, gds: STRING, visualisation: STRING, numOfRels: INTEGER, createdBy: STRING, filters: STRING, style: STRING, version: STRING, roles: LIST, numOfNodes: INTEGER, id: STRING, relationships: STRING, nodes: STRING, lastModified: INTEGER, name: STRING, createdAt: INTEGER}
Relationship properties are the following:
RATED {rating: FLOAT, timestamp: INTEGER}, ACTED_IN {role: STRING}, DIRECTED {role: STRING}
The relationships are the following:
(:Movie)-[:IN_GENRE]->(:Genre), (:User)-[:RATED]->(:Movie), (:Actor)-[:ACTED_IN]->(:Movie), (:Actor)-[:DIRECTED]->(:Movie), (:Director)-[:DIRECTED]->(:Movie), (:Director)-[:ACTED_IN]->(:Movie), (:Person)-[:ACTED_IN]->(:Movie), (:Person)-[:DIRECTED]->(:Movie), (:_Bloom_Perspective_)-[:_Bloom_HAS_SCENE_]->(:_Bloom_Scene_)

Node properties are the following:
Movie {posterEmbedding: LIST, url: STRING, runtime: INTEGER, revenue: INTEGER, budget: INTEGER, plotEmbedding: LIST, imdbRating: FLOAT, released: STRING, countries: LIST, languages: LIST, plot: STRING, imdbVotes: INTEGER, imdbId: STRING, year: INTEGER, poster: STRING, movieId: STRING, tmdbId: STRING, title: STRING}, Genre {name: STRING}, User {userId: STRING, name: STRING}, Actor {url: STRING, name: STRING, tmdbId: STRING, bornIn: STRING, bio: STRING, died: DATE, born: DATE, imdbId: STRING, poster: STRING}, Director {url: STRING, bornIn: STRING, bio: STRING, died: DATE, born: DATE, imdbId: STRING, name: STRING, poster: STRING, tmdbId: STRING}, Person {url: STRING, bornIn: STRING, bio: STRING, died: DATE, born: DATE, imdbId: STRING, name: STRING, poster: STRING, tmdbId: STRING}, _Bloom_Perspective_ {version: STRING, roles: LIST, id: STRING, name: STRING, data: STRING}, _Bloom_Scene_ {ranges: STRING, gds: STRING, visualisation: STRING, numOfRels: INTEGER, createdBy: STRING, filters: STRING, style: STRING, version: STRING, roles: LIST, numOfNodes: INTEGER, id: STRING, relationships: STRING, nodes: STRING, lastModified: INTEGER, name: STRING, createdAt: INTEGER}
Relationship properties are the following:
RATED {rating: FLOAT, timestamp: INTEGER}, ACTED_IN {role: STRING}, DIRECTED {role: STRING}
The relationships are the following:
(:Movie)-[:IN_GENRE]->(:Genre), (:User)-[:RATED]->(:Movie), (:Actor)-[:ACTED_IN]->(:Movie), (:Actor)-[:DIRECTED]->(:Movie), (:Director)-[:DIRECTED]->(:Movie), (:Director)-[:ACTED_IN]->(:Movie), (:Person)-[:ACTED_IN]->(:Movie), (:Person)-[:DIRECTED]->(:Movie), (:_Bloom_Perspective_)-[:_Bloom_HAS_SCENE_]->(:_Bloom_Scene_)

generated_cyphers:
MATCH (p:Product)-[r:PART_OF]->(c:Category)
RETURN c.categoryName AS CategoryName, AVG(p.unitsInStock) AS AverageUnitsInStock
ORDER BY AverageUnitsInStock DESC;

schema:
Node properties:
Movie {title: STRING, votes: INTEGER, tagline: STRING, released: INTEGER}
Person {born: INTEGER, name: STRING}
Relationship properties:
ACTED_IN {roles: LIST}
REVIEWED {summary: STRING, rating: INTEGER}
The relationships:
(:Person)-[:ACTED_IN]->(:Movie)
(:Person)-[:DIRECTED]->(:Movie)
(:Person)-[:PRODUCED]->(:Movie)
(:Person)-[:WROTE]->(:Movie)
(:Person)-[:FOLLOWS]->(:Person)
(:Person)-[:REVIEWED]->(:Movie)

